ucceed in  twisting the future and creating a  different outcome than the one sir  Knight I had foreseen Deku tossin  but he has to pull through because he  needs to see all mite again but then sir  night eye is presumably taken away to  receive treatment  now if Deku could change his fate then  perhaps all mite will be able to do so  as well this is definitely an  interesting development guys and despite  the heavy toll and many injuries the  rescue is complete and deku strong  desire to finally rescue Eddy has become  a reality everything seems fine as the  members of the eighth precepts of death  are being transported to a special  hospital for villains 11 members in  total along with the bullets and a  capsule that had not been previously  reported but as they are travelling in  the police vehicle they are cut off by a  truck and in that truck we see shigaraki  mr. compress and Dobby and they are  preparing to put their own plan into  motion so just when we thought that this  long intense arc had finally ended after  an epic and rewarding battle everything  changes in an instant as shigaraki  prepares to presumably capture all of  the members of the 8 precepts along with  their bullets and the mysterious capsule  now this capsule I am betting contains  the serum that chrono stasis had  mentioned earlier and of course in the  previous chapter we learned that  overhaul had planned to create a serum  that would restore the quirks of those  who lost them so that he could sell this  serum at a high price this is a huge  deal of course because this confirms  that our boy media will indeed be able  to regain his quirk one day the only  problem is that the serum will now  likely be in the hands of shigaraki and  the league of villains  now I just want to talk about shigaraki  for a second here we knew that once  token twice betrayed the 8 precepts that  he was up to something but I did not see  this coming instead of the legal  villains falling under the control of  the